{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3e8544c1-52d4-8407-bc8c-a6e9285dbbbf",
  "created_at": "2025-12-17T12:24:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Janice Gifford",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:22:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:22:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, hello. Sorry to bother you. I have a quick question about trash pickup. Is this the right number for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:22:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're in the right place. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:22:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I'm wondering about Christmas trees. Like, how does that work here? Do I just put it out at the curb with the regular trash, or is it separate? Sorry, I just moved in and I don't want to do it wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:23:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries at all. Okay, Christmas tree question. Generally the trees get their own collection after the holiday, so don't toss it in with your regular trash. Take any lights and tinsel off, and no bag around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:23:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bag. Okay. And the lights off. Got it. So just the bare tree, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:23:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bare tree, yep. Stand it by the curb where your barrel goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:23:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. And when is the next pickup? Like, the next regular one. I wasn't sure with the holiday coming up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:23:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull that up. Do you know your pickup day, or do you want me to look it up by street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:23:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I think it's Fridays? The people before me left a note on the fridge, but I'm not totally sure I'm reading it right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:23:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fridays, okay, writing that down. So with the rain coming through today and tomorrow, Friday should still be on as far as I know. If anything shifts for the weather or the holiday, it gets announced."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:24:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So Friday. Just to make sure, Friday this week, not next week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:24:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This Friday, yes. Then the following week is the holiday, so that's the one to watch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:24:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, perfect. Sorry, one more silly thing. My phone has this ringtone I can't figure out how to change, and it just went off while I was walking out. Not a city thing, obviously. I'm just distracted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:24:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can't help you with that one. Settings, sound, I think, but that's about all I've got."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:24:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, yeah. Sorry. Okay, so bare tree, Friday for regular pickup, and watch for the holiday week. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:24:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Stay dry out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-17T12:24:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks so much. Bye."
    }
  ],
